ng?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZR30HmFcZu4Q7kNvwGNRBhz&_nc_oc=AdqumQ-BhX9fKZzBHODB-U66leeOOkuv9uPzIrisPsl1oQ8csDwGETxkidOFaNeCAj0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_zkluu4-YkEy6ZIHVxpUXtE50f8o2wprRTF8emSSunbA&oe=6A381348"}, {"file_name": "485.png", "id": "1347490050607062", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312310_1347490053940395_2538575984175596059_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3yCHIvsm-aYQ7kNvwHO65lV&_nc_oc=AdpphCzX1JN_vV03_Ea9BWw3lEdPl1ASvZlTpdXjzxk1LAC6lm-YA3TveGf_RPZLpqo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af95Zgg71SW1DiRQFe1ZqcEJVWA9qUtDsTk-EHqGpt18Iw&oe=6A37F93B"}, {"file_name": "p1.png", "id": "1902884524441340", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_1902884527774673_5947211831912134388_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aEYM-YKMYf4Q7kNvwGVHj2s&_nc_oc=AdoIlQ-YD5_FJcvbL2dxcMxIdpykfSWVviX1JOuV2oc51EJAOdEiKanueUpXSdAI1qs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8jLdJgHtDMKn87WjqJlt3RidiAIH1tg3BPeEQVjOvK_w&oe=6A37F7B2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "45Untitled-3.png", "id": "1304882567893722", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311582_1304882571227055_7932779827118013997_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XsnT2n55eB8Q7kNvwGM9b8E&_nc_oc=Ado4tOmJLoJ2oo55cYGrSK9fwG6HHIUNB8cNrehsW3OZubYheBCoKZ6fejOoc_xrzJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9-K5zuzn9re7K-1eExiQl-7ZzHjihnyGMHcyLtrsLRIA&oe=6A3800AE"}, "display_name": "MissionRift", "keywords": ["missionrift", "portals", "mixedreality", "Mission"], "long_description": "Mission Rift turns your real environment into a mission-driven battleground. Your space sits above a dangerous rift, and you play as a secret agent defending it from spiders, soldiers, robots, ghosts, turrets, and dark creatures breaching in from an alternate reality. Fight through story chapters where terrifying worlds line up with your real layout.\n\nMap out multiple rooms and very large areas that shape into a massive battlefield, creating an experience that is both suspenseful and exhilarating. Enemies can flank, ambush, drop on you, and take cover using the environment around you.\n\nFight back with over 30 weapons, from pistols to rocket launchers, each with different damage, while experiencing environmental destruction effects throughout combat.\n\nFeaturing Story Mode, (Advanced Mesh Sandbox (Quest3/3s)), and Spider Kill, where you survive and eliminate as many spiders as possible under a time limit. More content to come.\n\n*Important\n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S and newer headsets support all game modes including Advanced Mapping Missions, allowing the game to scan and use more complex real-world environments.\n\n- Quest 2 players can still play Story Mode and Spider Kill Mode using Meta\u2019s manual room setup, where walls and doors are placed manually. Advanced Mapping-Sandbox modes are not available on older headsets because the headset does not support the same environment-mapping features.\n\nIf you enjoyed Mission Rift, please leave a review. Your support helps fund future updates!", "short_description": "Mission Rift turns any environment into a mission-driven battleground. As a secret agent, you defend your home from spiders, soldiers, robots, ghosts, and dark creatures breaching in from parallel worlds. Fight through chapters that transform your real space into terrifying alternate realities, from ancient temples to nightmare zones. Unlock new modes, advanced scanning, powerful abilities, and dozens of weapons as you survive the rift."}]}, "developer_name": "VirtualGo LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.virtualgoreality.com/information.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VirtualGo LLC", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/53d4NQnDE9", "website_url